{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/anthropic_model.py","reason":"Adapt Anthropic provider/client construction seam for SDKs whose http_client contract is httpx2 while preserving transport retry semantics."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_transport_retry.py","reason":"Add/adjust provider retry tests covering httpx2 construction, retry/backoff behavior, and sampling kwargs moved through extra_body under Anthropic 1.x."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_transport_retry_jitter.py","reason":"Existing shared _build_retry_wait Retry-After/jitter contract must remain green after generic exception/header parsing."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_packaging_dependencies.py","reason":"Update dependency-spec regression test from temporary cap to post-fix widened/lifted bound."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_llm_provider_factory.py","reason":"Update Anthropic provider factory seam tests to patch the SDK's selected stdlib-httpx or httpx2 transport and verify lifecycle/closure."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_llm_timeouts.py","reason":"Update Anthropic timeout tests to expect the SDK-selected http client exception type."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_llm_fallback_chain.py","reason":"Update fallback-chain tests to observe retrying clients under either stdlib-httpx or httpx2 contracts."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_agentic_message_cache.py","reason":"Update message-cache capture harness to use the SDK-selected http client module under the httpx2 contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_provider_parity.py","reason":"Update provider-parity capture harness to intercept the SDK-selected Anthropic transport and preserve sampling-payload parity under httpx2."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_cache_prefix_breakpoint.py","reason":"Update cache-breakpoint Anthropic model construction to use rebar's SDK-selected provider seam under httpx2."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_candidate_tracing.py","reason":"Update candidate-tracing failover harness to intercept the SDK-selected Anthropic transport under httpx2."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_candidate_tracing_oracle.py","reason":"Update held-out candidate-tracing oracle harness to intercept the SDK-selected Anthropic transport under httpx2."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_llm_config_gate_root.py","reason":"Update gate-root fallback socket harness to intercept the SDK-selected Anthropic transport under httpx2."},{"path":"pyproject.toml","reason":"Widen the temporary anthropic<1 cap introduced by 1f35 once the seam supports httpx2 while retaining a <2 major ceiling."},{"path":"uv.lock","reason":"Regenerate locked dependency graph for the updated anthropic SDK range."}]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"FILE_IMPACT","timestamp":1788237012152150001,"uuid":"b5406fa7-11a1-4b6f-a496-2b80dec0be66"}